'''Bats''' are small flying monsters that are most commonly found in numerous dark areas throughout [[Morytania]]. They are weak and pose little threat to players.

Stronger and larger variants of bats exist that can be used as alternatives for bat [[Slayer task]]s, such as the [[giant bat]] and [[albino bat]].

A bat found near [[Damis]] during [[Desert Treasure I]] can be used to [[safespot]] him by luring Damis and the other aggressive monsters behind it, making the fight considerably easier.

